WEBVTT

00:06.900 --> 00:08.900
Zenpukuji Park
To
Ogikubo Station

00:18.650 --> 00:19.650
It's morning!

00:42.550 --> 00:44.509
I'm awake.

00:44.510 --> 00:46.509
Oh no, I'll be late!

00:46.510 --> 00:48.429
Aah, made it.

00:48.430 --> 00:50.100
Good morn...

01:31.930 --> 01:34.390
Down the hatch.

02:00.500 --> 02:03.970
Gah! I'll be late!

02:10.680 --> 02:13.520
Let's see, where...? Ah!

02:18.400 --> 02:19.770
I'm going now!

02:35.290 --> 02:37.370
I'm going for real now!

02:43.800 --> 02:46.260
I'm really going for real now!

02:56.780 --> 02:58.400
Kindergarten

03:01.020 --> 03:01.730
Yea...

03:01.731 --> 03:03.650
Hey, Sonico!
Yea—

03:05.780 --> 03:09.199
I-I'm sorry! That must've been scary.

03:09.200 --> 03:11.119
Good morning!

03:11.120 --> 03:13.409
Good morning, Ayaka.

03:13.410 --> 03:16.660
Ayaka! You mustn't run out like that!

03:16.960 --> 03:18.830
I'm sorry, Sonico.

03:19.330 --> 03:20.080
It's fine.

03:20.081 --> 03:21.460
I'm sorry!

03:22.710 --> 03:23.460
No, no.

03:23.461 --> 03:26.260
It was my fault for trying to rush.

03:26.510 --> 03:31.220
I need to be more careful.
Thanks very much, Ayaka.

03:32.930 --> 03:35.430
You okay? You're in a
hurry to get to campus, right?

03:35.850 --> 03:38.230
Yes, but I'll make it in time.

03:38.350 --> 03:40.480
See you later!

03:40.650 --> 03:42.440
I'll be back!

03:43.570 --> 03:46.440
Are you ready? Beat goes on!

03:46.740 --> 03:49.239
Don't stop me now, beat goes on!

03:49.240 --> 03:50.660
Good morning, Sonico.

03:50.820 --> 03:52.370
Good morning!

03:53.580 --> 03:54.740
Hey there, Sonico.

03:55.370 --> 03:55.448
Good morning!

03:56.411 --> 03:58.500
Hoho o naderu Caressing my cheek

03:56.660 --> 03:58.980
Thanks for being such good customers!

03:58.981 --> 04:01.630
Yasashii kaze o ukete
I feel that gentle breeze

03:59.920 --> 04:01.460
She's full of energy.

04:01.790 --> 04:04.590
Arukidaseba When I walk out

04:04.750 --> 04:07.760
Yosougai no TOMORROW
An unexpected tomorrow awaits

04:07.960 --> 04:10.800
Shiitemasu ka?
Do you know

04:11.090 --> 04:13.760
Kono michi no yukisaki
Where this road leads?

04:14.010 --> 04:19.310
Hayaru kodou osaeteru yo
I'm holding back this impatient throbbing

04:20.810 --> 04:23.400
Dokidoki wa
The pounding of the heart

04:23.940 --> 04:26.520
Yume no tane
Is the seed of dreams

04:27.150 --> 04:31.450
Donna mirai ga saku ka na
I wonder what sort of future will bloom

04:32.530 --> 04:35.490
Imasugu, I DO! WHOA, OH, OH!
Right now, I do! Whoa, oh, oh!

04:35.700 --> 04:38.540
Mayowazu, WE DO! WHOA, OH, OH!
Without hesitation, we do! Whoa, oh, oh!

04:38.750 --> 04:44.330
Nayandetatte tsurete iku kara Even
if you have doubts, I'll bring you along

04:44.750 --> 04:47.880
Kyou kara, I DO! WHOA, OH, OH!
Starting today, I do! Whoa, oh, oh!

04:48.130 --> 04:51.009
Yokubari, WE DO! WHOA, OH, OH!
Greedily, we do! Whoa, oh, oh!

04:51.010 --> 04:55.349
Jibun no BEAT o sagashi ni ikou
Let's go find our own beat

04:55.350 --> 04:58.100
(Are you ready? Beat goes on!)

04:58.350 --> 05:00.810
(Don't stop me now, beat goes on!)

05:00.811 --> 05:02.105
Thank goodness. I made it!

05:01.520 --> 05:04.519
(Are you ready? Beat goes on!)

05:02.106 --> 05:03.190
Kimi to With you

05:04.520 --> 05:07.650
(Don't stop me now, beat goes on!)

05:20.870 --> 05:24.040
It's the wrong classroom!

05:35.220 --> 05:39.890
I was late again. That's the 13th time now.

05:40.140 --> 05:44.389
Today started with second period,
so I was sure I'd be fine.

05:44.390 --> 05:47.729
Well, you have chronic fatigue
and no sense of direction.

05:47.730 --> 05:51.029
Well, yes, but still...

05:51.030 --> 05:53.450
You don't have to be so down about it.

05:53.740 --> 05:55.319
You think so?

05:55.320 --> 05:57.529
Yup. I mean, even our professor...

05:57.530 --> 06:00.580
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

06:00.950 --> 06:02.410
No, it's fine.

06:02.910 --> 06:07.629
I know how disastrously
bad you are with mornings.

06:07.630 --> 06:10.670
He said that himself. I'm
sure he'll let you off the hook.

06:11.210 --> 06:12.629
You really think so?

06:12.630 --> 06:15.970
Yeah, but you've been ditching class
to work your part-time job, Sonico.

06:16.510 --> 06:20.350
Not to worry. She has good grades,
so I'm sure she'll be fine.

06:20.810 --> 06:22.310
You really think so?

06:22.720 --> 06:26.480
Yeah, but I don't think her attendance
record is gonna fool anyone.

06:30.020 --> 06:32.609
Whoa. They're really having fun with her.

06:32.610 --> 06:35.280
'Cause her reactions are so over the top.

06:36.570 --> 06:39.119
There are many opportunities in
the eastern Pacific Ocean

06:39.120 --> 06:42.450
for the pantropical spotted dolphin
and the yellowfin tuna to interact.

06:42.990 --> 06:48.210
However, as they prey on the same
types of fish, the two tend not to coexist.

06:48.500 --> 06:53.170
Now then, the pantropical spotted dolphin is
famous for jumping high from the water's surface,

06:53.340 --> 06:57.970
but there are other dolphins with the
same ability. Does anyone know which ones?

06:58.220 --> 06:59.050
Sir!

06:59.051 --> 07:00.180
Go ahead.

07:02.140 --> 07:04.890
The spinner dolphin
and the Clymene dolphin.

07:05.350 --> 07:12.070
Both have the ability to jump while spinning, and
are known to repeat the move with some regularity.

07:12.320 --> 07:16.400
However, the reason
they do this still isn't clear.

07:17.280 --> 07:18.990
Excellent, Miss Sonico.

07:19.740 --> 07:20.740
If only...

07:21.410 --> 07:25.080
If only you weren't always
late, you'd be perfect.

07:27.830 --> 07:29.290
I-I'm sorry!

07:31.000 --> 07:32.760
Sonico, you don't have
fourth period either?

07:32.920 --> 07:35.090
I'm through for today.

07:35.380 --> 07:41.589
Well then, we're going to a cake buffet at that
hotel in front of the station. Wanna come, Sonico?

07:41.590 --> 07:44.179
I heard it's an
all-you-can-eat sweets fair!

07:44.180 --> 07:46.889
A sweets fair? I kinda want to go.

07:46.890 --> 07:47.600
I know, right?

07:47.600 --> 07:48.060
Still...
I know, right?

07:48.061 --> 07:51.690
One of my upperclassmen said
the jelly rolls there are delicious!

07:51.810 --> 07:54.229
I heard the macarons are great, too!

07:54.230 --> 07:55.480
Macarons?

07:56.280 --> 07:58.109
They have macarons?

07:58.110 --> 08:01.779
So, if they have macarons,
I can eat all the macarons I want?!

08:01.780 --> 08:02.780
Uh, yeah.

08:06.290 --> 08:07.619
So, you're coming, Sonico?

08:07.620 --> 08:08.709
For sure.

08:08.710 --> 08:09.710
Ah!

08:09.830 --> 08:11.170
S-sorry.

08:12.290 --> 08:14.919
I have to get to my job.

08:14.920 --> 08:17.129
Oh. Yeah, the job.

08:17.130 --> 08:18.920
Well, guess it can't be helped.

08:19.340 --> 08:20.430
I'm sorry!

08:20.970 --> 08:22.469
You don't have to apologize.

08:22.470 --> 08:23.550
That's right!

08:23.850 --> 08:25.559
We'll go on your day off.

08:25.560 --> 08:28.060
The buffet's not going
anywhere. We'll be fine!

08:29.930 --> 08:32.400
For sure, for sure! I look forward to it!

08:33.020 --> 08:35.019
Good luck on the job today!

08:35.020 --> 08:36.899
Don't catch a cold in that skimpy outfit!

08:36.900 --> 08:39.780
No, I'll be fine. It's in a studio!

08:42.320 --> 08:44.280
Kichijoji Station

08:46.370 --> 08:49.700
Ah... I wanted to eat some macarons.

08:51.040 --> 08:55.169
At least one. Well, it's
all-you-can-eat, so, two...

08:55.170 --> 08:56.420
Sonico!

08:57.550 --> 08:59.090
We've been waiting!

08:59.380 --> 09:03.220
Ah! C-could it be I'm late again?

09:03.430 --> 09:09.220
No, no. Actually, the client suddenly
asked to move up the photo shoot.

09:09.850 --> 09:13.809
Sorry, but would you mind
starting the shoot right now?

09:13.810 --> 09:16.190
Um, sure. That's fine!

09:16.900 --> 09:20.859
You're the best. The client's
waiting in the basement studio.

09:20.860 --> 09:21.820
Um!

09:21.820 --> 09:22.450
Hm?

09:22.451 --> 09:23.659
Where's my manager?

09:23.660 --> 09:26.869
Mr. Kitamura? He had to
go out for something else,

09:26.870 --> 09:29.369
but he should be back by the time we
were scheduled to start.

09:29.370 --> 09:30.790
O-okay!

09:34.870 --> 09:36.790
G-good morning!

09:38.800 --> 09:42.840
I'm Kuwasaki from Bonbonsha.
Sorry to rush you like this.

09:43.260 --> 09:47.600
Our printer needs us to submit
materials as soon as possible.

09:48.010 --> 09:50.220
No, it's fine!

09:50.640 --> 09:53.430
This is our model, Super Sonico.

09:53.690 --> 09:59.730
I'm Super Sonico. It's a pleasure to be working
with you today. Thanks for the opportunity!

09:59.900 --> 10:02.399
Super Sonico, eh? Nice to meet you.

10:02.400 --> 10:05.489
Sir! I'll do my very best for you!

10:05.490 --> 10:08.410
Well, I'd like to quickly run
through the photo shoot.

10:08.660 --> 10:13.540
Our magazine, "Boboborn," is looking for
a model for its Reader Giveaway section.

10:14.160 --> 10:18.380
We just need a few shots of you
posing with the merchandise.

10:19.340 --> 10:20.340
Okay!

10:20.550 --> 10:23.459
This here is our photographer, Shimoura.

10:23.460 --> 10:24.630
Hello there.

10:25.130 --> 10:29.849
Your outfit's already in the dressing room.
Best of luck to you, Sonico.

10:29.850 --> 10:31.350
Um, thanks!

10:41.610 --> 10:43.190
Sorry for the wait!

10:49.990 --> 10:51.330
Nice!

10:53.040 --> 10:54.539
We're all ready here.

10:54.540 --> 10:57.079
Well, Sonico, if you're ready...

10:57.080 --> 10:58.080
Okay!

10:58.920 --> 11:01.000
Ah, thanks very much.

11:01.420 --> 11:04.799
Think you can just pose naturally?
I'll take a bunch of different shots.

11:04.800 --> 11:05.800
Sure!

11:15.100 --> 11:16.810
That's great, Sonico!

11:36.040 --> 11:37.710
So...

11:38.160 --> 11:39.789
Are they all right?

11:39.790 --> 11:42.209
Yeah. I think they turned out really well.

11:42.210 --> 11:43.670
Thanks very much!

11:44.050 --> 11:45.510
Right, Mr. Kuwasaki?

11:46.670 --> 11:50.340
They're good. Yes, very good, but...

11:51.390 --> 11:53.850
I wish there was more...

11:54.430 --> 11:57.479
I'd like it to appeal a
bit more to our readers.

11:57.480 --> 12:00.730
Have it be more
provocative, or sensational...

12:02.110 --> 12:02.770
That's it!

12:02.770 --> 12:03.230
Sir?

12:03.231 --> 12:04.729
Sorry, Miss Sonico, but...

12:04.730 --> 12:07.400
would you mind putting
on our backup outfit?

12:08.190 --> 12:10.950
I think this one will suit you more.

12:11.360 --> 12:13.240
I'm sure it'll make for some great photos!

12:14.330 --> 12:17.620
Oh, sure thing. I'll go change.

12:20.330 --> 12:22.789
Mr. Kuwasaki, we're going to use THAT?

12:22.790 --> 12:25.339
The agency will complain
if we stray too far from plan.

12:25.340 --> 12:29.669
Who cares? We need to really push the
boundaries, or the magazine won't sell!

12:29.670 --> 12:31.630
Yes, but that outfit...

12:32.390 --> 12:35.099
I wonder what he thinks will suit me.

12:35.100 --> 12:38.390
I hope it's a cute parka or
something nice and fluffy.

12:44.900 --> 12:46.110
This is...

12:48.650 --> 12:51.400
I have to wear this?

12:54.450 --> 12:56.200
Look, this is bad...

12:56.660 --> 12:58.700
Sorry for the wait.

13:00.160 --> 13:02.870
I-it took a little time...

13:06.210 --> 13:07.959
We're ready for you, Sonico!

13:07.960 --> 13:13.799
Sorry, 'kay? The swimsuit's a little revealing,
but that's magazines these days for you.

13:13.800 --> 13:16.929
It's like, that's what gets you popular!
You're embarrassed, huh?

13:16.930 --> 13:19.639
But next month's sales of "Boboborn" rest
on your shoulders! C'mon, please, Sonico!

13:19.640 --> 13:22.559
Uh, all this just for the Reader Giveaway photos? But next month's
sales of "Boboborn" rest on your shoulders! C'mon, please, Sonico!

13:22.560 --> 13:24.269
Uh, all this just for the Reader Giveaway photos? We just
can't wait to see your stuff! Uh, I mean, what you're made of.

13:24.270 --> 13:27.520
We just can't wait to see your stuff!
Uh, I mean, what you're made of.

13:28.440 --> 13:30.440
I... I'll do my best!

13:31.900 --> 13:33.400
Talk about naïve!

13:33.950 --> 13:35.030
Is this okay?

13:35.620 --> 13:37.280
Can we do this?

13:38.580 --> 13:39.700
Is this okay?!

13:41.500 --> 13:42.660
Yeah, I think it's okay.

13:43.370 --> 13:45.830
Well, Sonico, when you're ready.

13:47.920 --> 13:52.260
This seems rather different from what your
e-mailed request mentioned.

13:52.760 --> 13:55.589
Would you please explain
the meaning of this?

13:55.590 --> 13:59.140
I-it's an on-site decision!
To get the best pictures we can, we...

14:06.560 --> 14:07.980
A... A...

14:08.310 --> 14:10.980
DEMON MASK!

14:29.840 --> 14:31.709
Wh-wh-who are you?!

14:31.710 --> 14:34.839
Ah, this is my manager, Mr. Kitamura.

14:34.840 --> 14:36.179
SHE'S SO CALM!

14:36.180 --> 14:37.310
- GEORIDE INC.
- MANAGER

14:36.180 --> 14:37.310
KITAMURA

14:37.311 --> 14:41.930
I'm Kitamura, Super Sonico's
manager. How do you do?

14:42.100 --> 14:42.850
U-uh...

14:42.850 --> 14:43.850
D... Did you...

14:43.850 --> 14:44.850
"Dude"?

14:45.020 --> 14:51.980
You may be clients, but don't you think calling
someone "dude" upon your first meeting is a bit coarse?

14:52.110 --> 14:53.649
Uh, no, I didn't...

14:53.650 --> 14:54.940
That's not what he meant!

14:56.900 --> 14:58.989
You've taken some nice photos, haven't you?

14:58.990 --> 15:00.909
Ah, thanks very much!

15:00.910 --> 15:04.830
It would seem you've had her change
to take these once again.

15:05.120 --> 15:08.500
Additional photography would exceed
the terms of the contract.

15:08.670 --> 15:12.750
Further, if the outfit goes beyond
the level of decency I have allowed...

15:13.300 --> 15:17.550
then, for as long as I live,
you shall never know forgiveness.

15:19.300 --> 15:20.549
His eyes went white!

15:20.550 --> 15:23.850
They're glowing! And
smoke or something came out!

15:24.720 --> 15:25.430
Sonico.

15:25.430 --> 15:26.180
Um, yes?

15:26.181 --> 15:29.229
You're done for today. Good work.

15:29.230 --> 15:30.230
Huh?!

15:31.110 --> 15:32.819
A-are you sure?

15:32.820 --> 15:35.939
Not to worry. You've fulfilled
the terms of your contract.

15:35.940 --> 15:39.610
You're helping out at your
grandmother's after this, aren't you?

15:40.700 --> 15:42.529
Please, hurry and run along.

15:42.530 --> 15:45.080
Thanks very much, manager!

15:45.870 --> 15:50.000
Um, I'm sorry, but I'll be leaving now.

16:03.430 --> 16:04.810
Shimoura!

16:04.930 --> 16:05.930
Sir!

16:06.270 --> 16:08.350
You bastards! No photos!

16:08.360 --> 16:09.840
PUB

16:08.360 --> 16:11.309
TODAY'S SPECIALS

16:09.841 --> 16:11.320
ZEP PE LIN

16:11.310 --> 16:13.310
Cheers!

16:20.490 --> 16:22.029
Sonico, some miso-cucumber!

16:22.030 --> 16:22.820
Okay!

16:22.820 --> 16:23.620
Chicken wings!

16:23.620 --> 16:24.410
Beef stew, please!

16:24.411 --> 16:25.870
Coming right up.

16:26.740 --> 16:29.329
Grandma, the usual, please.

16:29.330 --> 16:30.870
Okay, the usual.

16:32.210 --> 16:36.709
This beef stew is the best!
Leyla! Please marry me!

16:36.710 --> 16:37.710
Yeah, yeah.

16:37.711 --> 16:40.129
This fool's been sayin' that for 40 years!

16:40.130 --> 16:41.470
He just never learns.

16:41.720 --> 16:44.969
Actually, Sonico made the stew today.

16:44.970 --> 16:45.810
Huh?!

16:45.811 --> 16:46.890
Sonico did?

16:47.060 --> 16:49.230
I just helped grandma a little, that's all.

16:49.930 --> 16:53.900
This flavor... Okay!
Let's get married, Sonico!

16:54.730 --> 16:56.729
That's hot! Gah, so hot!

16:56.730 --> 16:59.400
You shouldn't tease a young girl.

17:00.280 --> 17:01.989
Sonico, another please!

17:01.990 --> 17:02.530
Huh?

17:02.820 --> 17:05.739
You shouldn't. That was
already your sixth one.

17:05.740 --> 17:08.700
The way she said that was just like
Leyla when she was young.

17:08.910 --> 17:09.999
They sure are alike now.

17:10.000 --> 17:11.409
That means we gotta get married!

17:11.410 --> 17:13.249
Sorry, another beer here!

17:13.250 --> 17:14.250
Coming!

17:16.680 --> 17:17.640
- INCOMING CALL
- SUZU

17:18.500 --> 17:19.590
It's Suzu?

17:20.010 --> 17:21.010
Hello?

17:21.550 --> 17:22.550
Huh?

17:23.340 --> 17:25.510
Right now? Yeah.

17:25.850 --> 17:27.140
But I'm still...

17:27.760 --> 17:28.760
Ah!

17:28.810 --> 17:29.640
Jeez.

17:29.641 --> 17:31.850
She said she wanted to tell
me something and hung up.

17:32.390 --> 17:35.439
Sonico, that's enough for today. Get going.

17:35.440 --> 17:36.980
Huh? But...

17:38.270 --> 17:40.820
Fine, I'll take these beers.

17:41.240 --> 17:43.609
Beer is now self-service!

17:43.610 --> 17:44.659
Sure thing, Boss!

17:44.660 --> 17:46.490
"Boss," huh? Say it again!

17:47.830 --> 17:50.160
Say hello to your bandmates for me.

17:50.870 --> 17:56.130
Okay. Thank you! And thank you all, too!

17:57.630 --> 18:00.615
PUB

17:57.630 --> 18:02.419
TODAY'S SPECIALS

18:00.616 --> 18:03.600
ZEP PE LIN

18:02.420 --> 18:03.590
Man...

18:04.180 --> 18:07.009
Sonico's grown into a
wonderful young girl, huh?

18:07.010 --> 18:09.260
And her stew tastes
just like her grandma's!

18:09.510 --> 18:11.679
She's gotten good with
the shamisen, too, right?

18:11.680 --> 18:14.389
The guitar, you moron. Guitar!

18:14.390 --> 18:15.140
The guitar, huh?

18:15.141 --> 18:17.150
She still has a ways to go.

18:27.200 --> 18:29.450
I'm here, Suzu.

18:30.280 --> 18:32.660
Finally. Took your time, Nico!

18:33.750 --> 18:40.709
I'm sorry. So, you called me out of the blue
and told me to bring my guitar, but Suzu...

18:40.710 --> 18:44.969
Again, you're late. I came from work
without even changing.

18:44.970 --> 18:47.930
But where you work isn't that far at all!

18:48.220 --> 18:50.259
Aah, don't sweat the details.

18:50.260 --> 18:52.389
A hot tea with lemon, please.

18:52.390 --> 18:53.790
Ma'am.
A hot tea with lemon, please.

18:54.230 --> 18:59.810
So, what's going on, Suzu?
You said to meet and then just hung up.

19:01.440 --> 19:03.610
Come on, stop teasing!

19:04.320 --> 19:09.530
Sorry, sorry. I just get that way
whenever I see you, Nico.

19:10.910 --> 19:12.790
HERE'S what this is about.

19:13.450 --> 19:14.450
Ta-daa!

19:15.620 --> 19:18.249
Could that maybe,
possibly be the new song?!

19:18.250 --> 19:19.539
Very clever.

19:19.540 --> 19:21.419
You glad I called?

19:21.420 --> 19:27.549
Yup, yup! Like, big time! Suzu, I want to
hear it right now. Please let me hear it!

19:27.550 --> 19:28.550
Forget it.

19:28.970 --> 19:30.550
It'd be a waste to do it here.

19:30.760 --> 19:31.800
So then...

19:32.260 --> 19:38.980
SuperNova's open, and I reserved our
usual studio. Wanna have a little session?

19:39.650 --> 19:45.940
Great thinking, Suzu! Yeah, let's do it! I wanna
try! Oh. But if we're gonna play, we need Fuuri.

19:47.320 --> 19:48.950
I asked her, too, of course.

19:49.240 --> 19:54.870
I did it before I called you. She doesn't have
a cell phone, so I had to tell her directly.

19:55.330 --> 19:57.450
It looks like she's been here since noon.

19:58.370 --> 20:01.790
She's blissed out on seven plates of
the restaurant's famous mushroom curry.

20:02.290 --> 20:05.210
Or, rather, she ate so
much she fell asleep.

20:05.800 --> 20:06.840
Fuuri...

20:07.510 --> 20:10.719
She may be the one who's most
looking forward to the new song.

20:10.720 --> 20:12.049
I can't eat any more... But I could eat a meat bun... She
may be the one who's most looking forward to the new song.

20:12.050 --> 20:13.099
I can't eat any more... But I
could eat a meat bun...  Yeah.

20:13.100 --> 20:13.680
I can't eat any more... But
I could eat a meat bun...

20:13.680 --> 20:14.640
I can't eat any more... But I
could eat a meat bun...  I'm sure.

20:14.641 --> 20:16.770
I can't eat any more... But
I could eat a meat bun...

20:21.020 --> 20:24.110
Okay, you've learned
the new song's solo, right?

20:25.730 --> 20:27.569
Shall we give it a try?

20:27.570 --> 20:28.820
Sure thing!

20:31.030 --> 20:35.119
Okay, I come in on C, and the backing...

20:35.120 --> 20:35.990
Nico!

20:35.991 --> 20:37.619
Ah! Suzu!

20:37.620 --> 20:39.369
Don't overthink it.

20:39.370 --> 20:40.749
Huh? But...

20:40.750 --> 20:46.420
Don't overthink it.
Just let loose and DO it!

20:46.550 --> 20:50.129
Just play it how you feel it. What you want
takes maximum priority at maximum speed!

20:50.130 --> 20:53.640
That's why we named ourselves
First Astronomical Velocity, right?

20:58.140 --> 20:59.390
You're right.

21:00.560 --> 21:02.270
That's why you're the leader...

21:03.730 --> 21:04.810
Suzu!

21:13.700 --> 21:16.830
Yes. A lot happened today.

21:17.870 --> 21:19.410
I had mess-ups...

21:21.000 --> 21:22.960
And there was some trouble, too.

21:24.460 --> 21:25.630
But it was fun.

21:26.540 --> 21:28.460
Yes... It was fun!

21:33.840 --> 21:35.300
Here goes!

21:36.180 --> 21:40.520
SHARE ONE DREAM, afureru hikari
Share one dream, overflowing light

21:41.730 --> 21:43.559
Motto DAY BY DAY
More, day by day

21:43.560 --> 21:47.400
Mae e susume! Bokura to
Move forward! With us

21:47.560 --> 21:49.320
Love the world

22:01.080 --> 22:04.040
PEDAL o gyutto fumishimete
I stomp down on the gas

22:05.710 --> 22:10.210
Zensokuryoku de kakedashite yuku
And start racing off at full speed

22:13.380 --> 22:16.220
Mainichi ga zutto tanoshikute
Every day is so much fun

22:17.930 --> 22:22.730
Sonna hibi ga tsuzukimasu you ni
I hope these days will last

22:24.850 --> 22:27.230
Sunao na kimochi
Your true feelings

22:27.900 --> 22:30.900
Kotoba tsubuyaitara
Once you've whispered them as words

22:31.110 --> 22:36.700
Shunkan ga ugokidashita yo!
The moment has begun to move!

22:37.410 --> 22:41.410
SHARE ONE DREAM, fushigi na chikara
Share one dream, a mysterious power

22:43.000 --> 22:44.710
Kitto DAY BY DAY
Surely, day by day

22:45.000 --> 22:49.170
Minna kara todoku POWER
You'll receive power from everyone

22:49.630 --> 22:53.670
SHARE ONE DREAM, tsuyoku nareru yo
Share one dream, you can become stronger

22:55.260 --> 22:56.880
Motto, DAY BY DAY
More, day by day

22:57.220 --> 23:00.799
Mae e susume! Bokura to
Let's move forward! With us

23:00.800 --> 23:02.260
Love the world

23:05.560 --> 23:06.560
It's morning!

23:11.690 --> 23:13.610
I'm going now!

23:12.030 --> 23:16.030
Note: Sonico makes numerous spelling errors in her social
media posts, reflected here in the English captions

23:12.940 --> 23:14.485
SUPER SONICO

23:14.486 --> 23:16.030
TODAY, I'LL DO MY BEST~

23:18.280 --> 23:19.910
Here we go!

23:20.000 --> 23:24.999
I'll Do My Best~

23:25.000 --> 23:26.159
Next Episode Preview

